div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32822,31248,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32822, 31248, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Goblin</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Banker</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.40<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 10, 2008<br/>Winter Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230824232507&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Znozel_492381.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Znozel.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Inner%20City\">Inner City</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>, east of depot.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Znozel runs a bank in <a href=\"#/wiki/Yalahar\">Yalahar</a>. He exchanges <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coins</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coins</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coins</a>. You can deposit, withdraw, and transfer money as well as checking your account balance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Znozel.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Znozel</strong>: Hi there. Welcome to me gold storage called bank.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nZnozel: Me Znozel the great goblin banker!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bank</b><br/>\nZnozel: Me do good job! Me honest goblin for sure! Me that honest other goblin call me mad! Imagine!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>money</b><br/>\nZnozel: Just give good goblin all your money. Me making us both rich. Trust! Trust!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nZnozel: Me great good banker! Me smart and honey .. no wait I mean horrible .. no, no honest I am! Yes, yes! Money give, give to honest goblin! Uhhh so shiny coins!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>goblin</b><br/>\nZnozel: Goblins not bankers usually. But great love everything shiny. Yes. Yes.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yalahar</b><br/>\nZnozel: Me came here to plunder. Old banker hired me. When dragon eats banker for must waiting in line I taking over everything!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yalahari</b><br/>\nZnozel: Taxes, taxes! Always government is harassing harmless little goblins!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>dragon</b><br/>\nZnozel: Banker rule number one: Dragons are always served first!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>cookie</b><br/>\nZnozel: Me only take cookie if it's golden. Ehehehe.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Foreigner Quarter</b><br/>\nZnozel: Others there only bully little goblins around.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Arena and Zoo Quarter</b><br/>\nZnozel: Big humans there are mean. Big beasts even worse!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Alchemist Quarter</b><br/>\nZnozel: It gone BOOOM! Yes, yes! No good going there.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Magician Quarter</b><br/>\nZnozel: Spooky guys are not good for business.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Sunken Quarter</b><br/>\nZnozel: Me did not break it! Honest! Was broke as I came!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Factory Quarter</b><br/>\nZnozel: Many humans there. Seldom come here to trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Trade Quarter</b><br/>\nZnozel: This <a href=\"#/wiki/Mr.%20West\">West human</a> not too bad is. He great trader, strong chieftain.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nZnozel: Bye, bye. You gold safe at here, <i>Player</i>. &lt;snickers&gt;!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Znozel</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32822,"y":31248,"z":7}}